                number: 23,
                name: "XTAL_P",
                reserved: true,
                functions: [],
                note: "The C2 runs from a 26 MHz or a 40 MHz crystal, and neither a strap nor an eFuse records which: the ROM assumes 40 MHz, esp-hal 1.1 measures it at startup unless told. Chip revisions v0.0/v1.0 may fail with 40 MHz (errata XTAL-5948) - fit 26 MHz on those.",
            ),
            PinDef(
                number: 22,
                name: "XTAL_N",
                reserved: true,
                functions: [],
                note: "The C2 runs from a 26 MHz or a 40 MHz crystal, and neither a strap nor an eFuse records which: the ROM assumes 40 MHz, esp-hal 1.1 measures it at startup unless told. Chip revisions v0.0/v1.0 may fail with 40 MHz (errata XTAL-5948) - fit 26 MHz on those.",
            ),
