                    I2cScl(0),
                    I2cSda(0),
                ],
                note: "U0TXD: output-enabled after reset. With eFuse UART_PRINT_CONTROL left at 0 (default) the ROM prints its boot log here at reset - 115200 baud with a 40 MHz crystal, 74880 with 26 MHz - and the UART download mode answers here (the C2 has no USB). Espressif suggests a 499 ohm series resistor.",
            ),
            PinDef(
                number: 19,
                name: "GPIO19",
                reserved: false,
                functions: [
                    GpioInput,
